#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1290
msgid "Box art is GameTDB's, found by each game's name. Game icons are the games' own, read from their files, as the Switch's home menu shows them. A picture beside a game (Game.png or Game.jpg) is its cover either way."
msgstr "Sampul berasal dari GameTDB, dicari lewat nama tiap game. Ikon game adalah ikon milik game itu sendiri, dibaca dari file-nya, seperti yang ditampilkan menu HOME Switch. Gambar di samping game (Game.png atau Game.jpg) menjadi sampulnya dalam kedua kasus."

