msgstr "Silang mencari versi yang lebih baru di GitHub."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1385
msgid "PS5-ECAM asks GitHub for its latest release each time it starts. Cross asks again, or installs the newer version it found: the release's files are downloaded, checked and put in place of these, and the app starts again. Your games, saves and settings stay as they are."
msgstr "PS5-ECAM menanyakan rilis terbarunya ke GitHub setiap kali dimulai. Silang bertanya lagi, atau memasang versi lebih baru yang ditemukan: file rilis diunduh, diperiksa, dan dipasang menggantikan file ini, lalu aplikasi dimulai ulang. Game, data simpanan, dan pengaturanmu tetap seperti semula."

